msgid ""
"This will replace the %s text in every verse of the project with the selected Bible module.\n"
"\n"
"Because this text participates in source/destination associations, this affects all associations in the project.\n"
"\n"
"Choose Yes to try to keep all project associations by remapping them to the new text.\n"
"Choose No to replace the text and clear all project associations.\n"
"Choose Cancel to keep the current project text."
msgstr ""
"This will replace the %s text in every verse of the project with the selected Bible module.\n"
"\n"
"Because this text participates in source/destination associations, this affects all associations in the project.\n"
"\n"
"Choose Yes to try to keep all project associations by remapping them to the new text.\n"
